tories, Making your Github Profile Stand-out, and more.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/80b618ab6db4d4e859b8a3c2bfd4c2a7","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-08-28T23:46:18.116Z"},{"id":"SZ2a8hN_L","title":"My Journey into technology","url":"https://devdojo.com/imkarthikeyans/my-journey-into-technology","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/my-journey-into-technology-sz2a8hn-l","summary":"Karthikeyan Shanmugam was never interested in computer science after high school. He started learning to code using C and C++ and started poking around the internet to see what else he could do. Now he is working as Software Engineer @ Granicus mainly focused on web technologies to solve problems.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/fddefc790808dc6e049630734cd94ed3","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-08-27T23:29:07.067Z"},{"id":"N6HpcFr7U","title":"Set up Kubernetes role based access control","url":"https://devdojo.com/mwanjemike767/set-up-kubernetes-role-based-access-control","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/set-up-kubernetes-role-based-access-control-n6hpcfr7u","summary":"Kubernetes has a default view clusterrole which can be used for viewing of all resources in a cluster. We can now bind view-addition-for-k8s-dashboard-access clusterrole to the app-dev service account for it access the K8s dashboard. For the first part, we're in luck! We can just create a custom clusterrole.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/50934e239c38abb00eae0dbc1f3e11c1","num_upvotes":3,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-08-25T07:42:12.237Z"},{"id":"b6xZR-tOU","title":"How to force overwrite local changes with 'git pull'","url":"https://devdojo.com/smpnjn/how-to-force-overwrite-local-changes-with-git-pull","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-to-force-overwrite-local-changes-with-git-pull--b6xzr-tou","summary":"How to force overwrite local changes with 'git pull' Have you ever been working on a project in git and ran into an error telling you that you can't use git pull because you have local changes? error: Untracked working tree file 'App.vue' would be overwritten by merge.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/dda10ed9979664174effc6a44ad93ffb","num_upvotes":3,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-08-25T07:37:01.316Z"},{"id":"SID2Mqphf","title":"Send Time-based (TOTP) in Laravel using Fortify","url":"https://devdojo.com/mwangi/send-time-based-totp-in-laravel-using-fortify","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/send-time-based-totp-in-laravel-using-fortify-sid2mqphf","summary":"Laravel Fortify already has first support for 2fa inbuilt which you would have noticed in the Laravel Jetstream implementation of Fortify. The only downside to the implementation while being the most secure is that it requires use of an Authenticator application. We will opt here to instead hook onto the 2fa dispatched events which you can find in the associated pr here. Checkout our latest product - the ultimate tailwindcss page creator.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/26fc5c4a09a978e549dc4c761706ab95","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-08-23T06:49:20.497Z"},{"id":"-XeNuMJJR","title":"Creating an infinite scrollable list with JavaScript","url":"https://devdojo.com/posandu/creating-an-infinite-scrollable-list-with-javascript","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/creating-an-infinite-scrollable-list-with-javascript--xenumjjr","summary":"Infinite scroll is a modern web development technique that allows you to create an infinitely scrollable list. This is useful for creating a list of items that can be scrolled through without having to load the entire list into the browser. The End This is the end of the tutorial.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/3302614d373b32d113e81